# --------------------------- (2) refused `turn_running`: queued, once

[break] turn-running-is-not-sent-again
rule: A prompt refused `turn_running` is sent again, queued behind the turn that took the gap.
file: crates/cortex-tui/src/app/state.rs
in: App::prompt_answered
find: if error.code == code::TURN_RUNNING
replace: if false && error.code == code::TURN_RUNNING
caught-by:
    app::tests::prompts::enter_between_two_turns_is_sent_again_once_queued
    app::tests::prompts::a_held_prompt_refused_because_a_turn_runs_is_queued_and_those_behind_wait

[break] turn-running-is-sent-again-unqueued
rule: The prompt sent again after `turn_running` is queued, so that it runs after the turn that took the gap.
file: crates/cortex-tui/src/app/state.rs
in: App::prompt_answered
find: let ticket = self.send_prompt(again, Some(ItemDelivery::Queue));
replace: let ticket = self.send_prompt(again, None);
caught-by:
    app::tests::prompts::enter_between_two_turns_is_sent_again_once_queued

[break] turn-running-is-sent-again-without-end
rule: A prompt refused `turn_running` is sent again once: a second refusal gives it back.
file: crates/cortex-tui/src/app/state.rs
in: App::prompt_answered
find: && !sent.again
replace:
caught-by:
    app::tests::prompts::a_second_turn_running_refusal_gives_the_prompt_back

[break] a-prompt-refused-after-an-interrupt-is-sent-again
rule: A prompt refused after an interrupt was sent comes back, and is not queued behind the turn the person stopped.
file: crates/cortex-tui/src/app/state.rs
in: App::prompt_answered
find: && !sent.stopped
replace:
caught-by:
    app::tests::prompts::a_prompt_refused_after_an_interrupt_comes_back_and_is_not_sent_again

[break] a-prompt-is-sent-again-to-a-session-left
rule: A prompt refused `turn_running` after its session was left comes back, and is not sent again to the session closed.
file: crates/cortex-tui/src/app/state.rs
in: App::prompt_answered
find: && self.is_open(&sent.session) =>
replace: =>
caught-by:
    app::tests::prompts::a_prompt_refused_after_its_session_was_left_comes_back

[break] a-held-prompt-sent-again-lets-the-next-go-at-once
